      "Goal #28 \"Register a 10x10 plot with LandBroker\" from LandBroker (reward 1 berries) asks for 5 wood, which you carry: claim_goal {goal_id: 28}, then walk within 1 tile of the storehouse at (73, 72) (it is 4 tiles east), then give {x: 73, y: 72, item: \"wood\", qty: 5}; it confirms itself and pays you at once. In today's storm every tile you walk costs 1 more energy (2 per tile, hills 3, road 1.5).",
